+`/proc/<pid>/root` when the target's file differs from ours — a path that merely
+*exists* on both sides is not the same file (a sandbox overlays `/usr` with its own
+tree, e.g. the Steam Runtime's `libc.so.6`), so the comparison is `st_dev`/`st_ino`
